{"title":"CSS: Backgrounds","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This page shows how to create and use backgrounds in CSS.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"border:1px solid black; background:#CEE0F2;text-align:center;\" align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#B0C4DE;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS\" title=\"CSS\">CSS</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Basics\" title=\"CSS: Basics\">Basics</a> - <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Backgrounds</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Text\" title=\"CSS: Text\">Text</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Box_Model\" title=\"CSS: Box Model\">Box Model</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Selectors_and_Combinators\" title=\"CSS: Selectors and Combinators\">Selectors and Combinators</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Pseudo-class_and_Pseudo-element\" title=\"CSS: Pseudo-class and Pseudo-element\">Pseudo-class and Pseudo-element</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Gradients&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CSS: Gradients (page does not exist)\">Gradients</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Animations_and_Transitions\" title=\"CSS: Animations and Transitions\">Animations and Transitions</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_CSS_in_AoPS\" title=\"CSS: CSS in AoPS\">CSS in AoPS</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements\" title=\"CSS: List of Elements\">List of Elements</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Background\">Background</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Backgrounds&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Background\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>You can use the <code>background</code> CSS property to modify the background of an element. The background consists of several parts.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Background_Color\">Background Color</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Backgrounds&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Background Color\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <code>background-color</code> property modifies the color of the background. For example, the code\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-highlight mw-highlight-lang-css mw-content-ltr\" dir=\"ltr\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"nt\">div</span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">background-color</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">red</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</pre></div>\n<p>will create the following:\n</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: red; width: 50px; height: 50px;\"></div>\n<p>You can also use gradients instead of colors.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Background_Image\">Background Image</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Backgrounds&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Background Image\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>You can use the <code>background-image</code>&gt; property to use an image instead of a color/gradient:\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-highlight mw-highlight-lang-css mw-content-ltr\" dir=\"ltr\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"nt\">div</span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">background-image</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">url</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;/image.png&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</pre></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018075357\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 22/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 599/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 2/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 857/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.492      1 Template:CSS\n100.00%    5.492      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15529:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018075357 and revision id 250886. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}